<title>POLAND: OKOCIM NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.12 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.26 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.77 vs   0.87</p>
<p> Sales		   16.45 vs   9.39</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    25.54 vs  13.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	47.85 vs  26.61</p>
<p> Operating profit    39.98 vs  34.68</p>
<p> Sales		  204.42 vs 148.12</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Okocimskie Zaklady</p>
<p>Piwowarskie SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
